          "talks": [
            {
              "text": {
                "de": "Miau…",
                "en": "Meow…",
                "es": "Miau...",
                "fr": "Miaou~~~",
                "ja": "にゃ～～～",
                "ko": "야옹~~",
                "th": "เมี้ยว...",
                "zh-Hans": "喵~~~",
                "zh-Hant": "喵~~~"
              },
              "id": 1,
              "speaker": {
                "id": 1086,
                "name": {
                  "zh-Hans": "猫咪"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text": {
                "de": "(Es scheint, als wäre es nicht in Stimmung, wahrscheinlich hat es genug von Fisch. Vielleicht wäre etwas rohes Fleisch genau das Richtige.)",
                "en": "(Looks like it's not in the mood, probably gotten tired of eating Fish. Maybe some Raw Meat would do the trick.)",
                "es": "(Parece que no está de humor, probablemente se haya cansado de comer Pescado. Quizás un poco de Carne cruda haría el truco.)",
                "fr": "(Il ne semble pas vouloir bouger, essayez de lui donner de la viande?)",
                "ja": "（とても動いてくれるような雰囲気じゃない……餌でもあげてみよう）",
                "ko": "(움직이기 싫어하는 듯한데 생선 살코기가 질린 건가... 짐승고기라도 먹여볼까?)",
                "th": "(ดูเหมือนมันจะไม่มีอารมณ์แฮะ บางทีมันอาจจะเบื่อปลาแล้วก็ได้ ลองให้เนื้อดิบแทนอาจจะช่วยได้)",
                "zh-Hans": "（它好像不愿意动的样子，可能吃腻了鱼肉，给它喂点兽肉试试吧？）",
                "zh-Hant": "（它好像不願意動的樣子，可能吃膩了魚肉，給它喂點獸肉試試吧？）"
              },
              "id": 0,
              "speaker": {
                "id": 83,
                "name": {
                  "zh-Hans": "Speaker_83_Name"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
